  <div id="panel-tax" hidden>
    <div class="card tax-card">
      <span class="tax-badge">Worked example · not tax advice</span>
      <h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600;">Cross-border tax research</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--text-2); font-size:13.5px; max-width:60ch; margin:0.6rem 0 0;">
        Mechanisms explained and scenarios modeled using this template's sample numbers —
        not a substitute for advice from a registered tax agent, and nothing here should be
        relied on for a real filing or decision. Full sourced write-up with citations:
        <code style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:12.5px;">tax/research.md</code>
