          shares/ETFs — Northbridge and Meridian's US positions both qualify; crypto's situs is a
          genuine unsettled question). A US-Australia treaty extends a much larger exemption, but
          only if "domiciled" in Australia — a different, higher bar than tax residency, and
          genuinely fact-specific. No equivalent NZ-US treaty exists. The highest-dollar open
